					"font-size": {
						"type": "float",
						"value": 19
					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "ENVELOPE FOLLOWER\n\nThe Envelope Follower \"follows'' the incoming signal with a given attack and release time. One way to see this node is as a more customizable Smooth node. \n\nThe attack value will determine how fast the Envelope Follower will catch up with the incoming signal. The release value will set how long it takes to return.\n\nBy default the Envelope Follower will output the absolute of its output (meaning nog negative values). This can be turned on or off in the node panel."
					}
				},
				"bounds": {
